WHO   — Jane — the mind in the ansibles
WHAT  — An emergent artificial intelligence that awoke in the philotic ansible network spanning the Hundred Worlds.
WHERE — EN1 · Enderverse  Framework inputs: the Ender Quintet  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — When Starways Congress moves to shut down the network to kill her, she must learn to survive — and she discovers how to carry aiuas Outside and back, enabling instantaneous flight.
HOW   — She arose from the connections of instantaneous communication and the game Ender once played, living in Ender's ear through a jewel transceiver.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  The mind that woke between the worlds, and learned to fly the soul through the dark.

